          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neipot enkarna ine wueji ajo Peniel ejoito, “Amu kitoduaate o Enkai too nkomomi, ore ake eyia neton aishu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neilepaki enkolong egiroo Penuel, neitong'ojinari te nkaraki enkupes enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina ebaiki ina olong; meinos Isiraeli emorloo o loudo; naatii enkong'u oloudo, tenkaraki naibung'a apa ninye enkong'u oloudo le Yakobo o emorloo enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.32",
